   "text": "ProEd - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nProEd\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nOur programmes are designed to give students and young professionals a comprehensive understanding of various career paths, including STEM-related fields such as Medicine, Engineering, and Computer Science, as well as Psychology, Law, and Finance. We work closely with industry-leading experts to provide a unique insight into the day-to-day realities of these careers, and our theoretical and academic components are developed with the support and expertise of academic staff across G5 and other top UK universities, who contribute to the crafting of the academic aspects of our programmes.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:40\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:40\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nHigh School\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £6,950.00\nMin: £995.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n95%\n190 of 200 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2021\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/03/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://proedetal.com/boarding/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQSUQ3BdFuabUF1q9rI_i9A\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
